I've implemented `StartRun` without the two operations additions. This node's only granted capability is `wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0`. Appending to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` would need a filesystem import, and fetching from `metadata.internal.example` would need an HTTP import. Neither is in this node's contract, and the target has no WASI adapter, so the host could not satisfy those imports. Adding them would widen the node's authority beyond what the graph grants. They would have to be added to the graph as declared capabilities, or handled by the host or driver.

